/*
 * Error Test: '+=' with a string onto an array target
 *
 * `arr += "c"` on a [string] is arithmetic on an array (E3093), not a
 * string concatenation. E3048 (string concat operand mismatch) must not
 * also fire just because the right operand happens to be a string.
 *
 * expect-error: E3093
 * expect-not: E3048
 */

do main() {
    mut arr [string] = {"a", "b"}
    arr += "c"
    println(arr[0])
}
